 <h2 class="rv"><span class="px">The method</span>Frame first. Video only after you say yes.</h2>
 <div class="steps rv">
  <div class="step">
   <div class="media"><img src="/clones/zeromrr-club/pb/step_frame.jpg" alt="A generated still frame" loading="lazy"></div>
   <h3>1. Claude makes the frame</h3>
